Date: Wed, 17 Dec 2025 21:57:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Update pod update strategy due to configmap changes

Roll the server pods when the rendered ConfigMap changes. cm.yaml
mutates .Values while rendering (it unsets
serverFiles."prometheus.yml".scrape_configs and rewrites
scrapeConfigs.*.relabel_configs). Helm renders deploy.yaml before
cm.yaml, so render the checksum copy from a deep copy of .Values to
leave the values the ConfigMap is rendered from unchanged.
---
 charts/prometheus/templates/deploy.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/charts/prometheus/templates/deploy.yaml b/charts/prometheus/templates/deploy.yaml
index d0b8231abf06..09d97c20acbe 100644
--- a/charts/prometheus/templates/deploy.yaml
+++ b/charts/prometheus/templates/deploy.yaml
@@ -67,6 +67,7 @@ spec:
     metadata:
       annotations:
         kubectl.kubernetes.io/default-container: {{ template "prometheus.name" . }}-{{ .Values.server.name }}
+        checksum/config: {{ include (print $.Template.BasePath "/cm.yaml") (set (omit . "Values") "Values" (deepCopy .Values)) | sha256sum }}
         {{- with .Values.server.podAnnotations }}
         {{- toYaml . | nindent 8 }}
         {{- end }}
